                            </span>
                            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-tactas-accent-line">{slice.phase} / {slice.label}</p>
                          </div>
                          <h3 class="mt-6 max-w-[34rem] text-[34px] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-normal sm:text-[42px]">{slice.title}</h3>
                          <p class="mt-5 max-w-[31rem] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/74 sm:text-[16px]">{slice.body}</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
